  description: "For the town's charmed had inevitably brought some unwanted folk..
    and one of them, was a young mage. He was a passionate young man, always polite
    and helpful. \n\nHowever... his passion for the dark arts, ended up being his
    downfall, as well as the citys' downfall.\nThe more he knew, the more bitter
    and agitated he became. He came to the conclusion, that those who were not worthy,
    deserved nothing less than death."
